归去来 (Gui Qu Lai) — episode 2 of the user's Bilibili series. A Chinese ink wash film made entirely in code.
No photographs, no AI-generated images.
  The brush engine, rice-paper compositor, landscape and figure rig (src/ink.js, comp.js, land.js, figure.js)
  are adapted from the Chinese Ink Wash style of the Lemo-Opuscar library (github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar), MIT License,
  Copyright (c) 2026 SecondFirst Pty Ltd, trading as LemoLab — licence text in LICENSE-engine-MIT.txt.
Story, script, shots, props, inscriptions and score are original to this film.

